 "releases": [
  {
   "id": "papetura-121567@major-2022-09-08",
   "gameId": "papetura-121567",
   "displayName": "Pad Controller Update is here!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-09-08T11:46:57.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For past months I've been working on pad controller support for Papetura, and.. it's here!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The game supports now various pads, from xbox to pro controller, it should work fine. The gameplay feel quite different, so I encourage you to try it! Also vibrations work, but you can turn them down in game menu if you don't like them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Everything should work fine on SteamDeck, I've tested it myself, but if you catch something off - please let me know!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Also at any point in the game you can switch to mouse control flawlessly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Together with that",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Major update was to made to the game engine (Unity 2018 -> Unity 2020).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some graphical assets fixes, and many minor improvements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Apple Silicon support has been added.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That was a lot of work, and I hope you will like new controls. Now Pape can interact with everything within a reach of his hand. Have fun and share your thoughts!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "All the best,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tomasz Ostafin",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
